ce that keeps you engaged all the time.\nIf the devs continue delivering these wonderful updates the game will be even more addicting in the future.\n", "timestamp_created": 1657234020, "timestamp_updated": 1657234020, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "118415780", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996468677", "personaname": "hbivnm", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/HybridVenom/", "num_games_owned": 365, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 361, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 84, "last_played": 1744228163, "avatar": "bbac121b97eb742137da63e64b8a04ef5c4579fc"}, "language": "english", "review": "* Dope artstyle\n* Decent movement (at least fluid to some degree)\n* Interesting guns and upgrades\n\n... but the game runs my computer HOTTER than Counter-Strike 2 at max settings, limiting FPS has no effect on this (externally or through in-game settings)\n\nCPU@CS2 max settings (crowded server): ~64.0-70.0 °C\nCPU@Roboquest lowest settings (at hub): ~84.0-85.0 °C (FPS limited to 144)\n\nThe game even warns you if you don't limit the FPS that it might overheat your CPU/GPU, seriously guys.. ??", "timestamp_created": 1657232981, "timestamp_updated": 1719947308, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47413790225982666", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}